2026-10-13T10:18:54.1761655Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1762002Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1762351Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1762692Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1763011Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1763430Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1763817Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1764164Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T10:18:54.1764837Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
